      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FROMELLES POPPY (2) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 1.5 lengths from RAMBO'S SHOUT in third (27.85) at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Capable of going well again. RAMBO'S SHOUT (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 27.75 beating Just A Foreman. Goes very well from this draw with four wins and four minor placings from eight starts. Sure to measure up. MY MUM MIA (8) produced a moderate effort last time when seventh at this track over 300m behind Barium (17.72) in a Grade 5. Should be in this for a long way. GO BOY (4) must be respected at his pet distance.",
